1
00:00:44,460 --> 00:00:45,530
[Unsoiled Starlight]

2
00:00:45,550 --> 00:00:47,050
[Episode 27]

3
00:00:47,070 --> 00:00:47,510
[Adapted from Migu's novel
“Unsoiled Starlight” ]

4
00:00:47,540 --> 00:00:47,960
[Original Writer: Shan Gu Jun]

5
00:00:48,280 --> 00:00:54,240
[Five years later, Hua'an City]

6
00:00:59,400 --> 00:01:00,400
Attorney Shu.

7
00:01:07,400 --> 00:01:08,880
Thank you so much, Attorney Shu.

8
00:01:08,880 --> 00:01:10,080
I don't know what I'd have done

9
00:01:10,080 --> 00:01:11,610
with this case without you.

10
00:01:12,039 --> 00:01:12,800
Of course.

11
00:01:12,800 --> 00:01:13,680
It's my job.

12
00:01:13,780 --> 00:01:14,960
I'd better get going.

13
00:01:14,960 --> 00:01:15,560
Take care.

14
00:01:18,700 --> 00:01:19,520
Attorney Shu.

15
00:01:19,680 --> 00:01:21,039
Heading out already?

16
00:01:21,160 --> 00:01:22,840
Come eat with us in the cafeteria.

17
00:01:22,840 --> 00:01:24,000
That's kind of you, but you don't have to.

18
00:01:24,000 --> 00:01:25,960
If the community needs anything,

19
00:01:25,960 --> 00:01:26,960
just give me a call.

20
00:01:26,960 --> 00:01:27,880
Here's my card.

21
00:01:28,090 --> 00:01:30,180
[Shu Tinglan, Senior Partner]

22
00:01:28,360 --> 00:01:29,080
Will do.

23
00:01:30,140 --> 00:01:30,760
Attorney Shu.

24
00:01:30,760 --> 00:01:31,840
You're so good at what you do.

25
00:01:31,840 --> 00:01:32,560
We'd love to bring you

26
00:01:32,560 --> 00:01:33,880
every case we have.

27
00:01:34,240 --> 00:01:35,100
I should go now.

28
00:01:35,880 --> 00:01:36,479
Take care.

29
00:01:40,910 --> 00:01:41,590
Hello.

30
00:01:43,039 --> 00:01:44,520
Yay, school's out!

31
00:01:44,520 --> 00:01:45,600
Time to go home!

32
00:01:46,920 --> 00:01:47,720
Mom.

33
00:01:47,720 --> 00:01:49,080
Don't worry.

34
00:01:49,120 --> 00:01:50,960
I met Yi Muyang

35
00:01:50,960 --> 00:01:52,600
outside the school.

36
00:01:52,920 --> 00:01:53,920
hello.

37
00:01:54,120 --> 00:01:57,160
He says to get home safe, too.

38
00:01:57,479 --> 00:01:58,160
Got it.

39
00:01:58,600 --> 00:02:00,090
Don't let her eat junk food.

40
00:02:00,090 --> 00:02:01,280
I'll cook when I get home.

41
00:02:01,280 --> 00:02:01,880
Tinglan.

42
00:02:01,970 --> 00:02:03,040
Don't bother cooking.

43
00:02:03,040 --> 00:02:04,960
Nianhe wants

44
00:02:04,960 --> 00:02:06,120
my hot pot tonight.

45
00:02:06,160 --> 00:02:07,360
I bought everything.

46
00:02:07,800 --> 00:02:08,600
Yi Muyang.

47
00:02:08,639 --> 00:02:10,240
That's not fair.

48
00:02:10,320 --> 00:02:12,440
You can't decide to eat something yummy

49
00:02:12,440 --> 00:02:14,680
without asking me.

50
00:02:14,760 --> 00:02:16,320
Fine. I'll take you

51
00:02:16,320 --> 00:02:18,040
to have Tinglan's fried rice.

52
00:02:18,360 --> 00:02:20,360
I'll have the hot pot.

53
00:02:20,480 --> 00:02:22,320
That's not fair either.

54
00:02:22,320 --> 00:02:24,960
I never said I wanted Mom's dinner.

55
00:02:25,000 --> 00:02:26,320
So you're not hungry.

56
00:02:26,320 --> 00:02:27,079
Is that it?

57
00:02:28,000 --> 00:02:29,000
No, that's not it.

58
00:02:32,440 --> 00:02:33,530
Come on, let's go home.

59
00:02:33,530 --> 00:02:34,730
We're having hot pot!

60
00:02:43,960 --> 00:02:45,000
To celebrate

61
00:02:46,400 --> 00:02:48,000
our 1,000th day of marriage.

62
00:02:55,390 --> 00:02:57,940
♪ Under cloudy skies, I look up ♪

63
00:02:58,310 --> 00:03:01,720
♪ Numbness is enough ♪

64
00:03:01,360 --> 00:03:02,160
Tinglan.

65
00:03:02,140 --> 00:03:06,920
♪ I don't ask for fairy-tale scenes ♪

66
00:03:04,140 --> 00:03:05,560
I made the fish

67
00:03:07,780 --> 00:03:08,960
less salty today.

68
00:03:09,890 --> 00:03:15,260
♪ I don't ask for fairy-tale scenes ♪

69
00:03:14,540 --> 00:03:15,920
And I made some greens.

70
00:03:16,300 --> 00:03:20,980
♪ I don't expect anyone to stay ♪

71
00:03:17,090 --> 00:03:18,640
You never did like greens.

72
00:03:22,780 --> 00:03:26,660
♪ Then I met you, in this moment ♪

73
00:03:26,750 --> 00:03:29,680
♪ Like drifting into a dream ♪

74
00:03:30,440 --> 00:03:35,720
♪ In the dream, stars carry a boat
toward the shore ♪

75
00:03:36,170 --> 00:03:39,200
♪ Your faint light lingers ♪

76
00:03:39,480 --> 00:03:43,610
♪ Spreading a warm current
through my heart ♪

77
00:03:43,910 --> 00:03:46,030
♪ Our eyes meet ♪

78
00:03:46,750 --> 00:03:49,970
♪ Bit by bit, healing the wounds ♪

79
00:03:51,790 --> 00:03:54,490
♪ I fear when the dream ends ♪

80
00:03:55,290 --> 00:03:56,720
Mom, you're home.

81
00:03:56,720 --> 00:03:58,480
We're starving.

82
00:03:59,120 --> 00:03:59,850
Come on, eat.

83
00:04:00,160 --> 00:04:01,080
Dig in.

84
00:04:03,120 --> 00:04:04,600
Put some meat in.

85
00:04:05,040 --> 00:04:07,760
Did you listen to your teacher
at kindergarten today?

86
00:04:07,760 --> 00:04:08,880
I did.

87
00:04:09,120 --> 00:04:10,920
I listened to Yi Muyang, too.

88
00:04:11,680 --> 00:04:13,600
He told me not to tell Mom

89
00:04:13,840 --> 00:04:15,570
about the fried rice you made--

90
00:04:16,160 --> 00:04:17,290
What are you saying?

91
00:04:17,880 --> 00:04:19,279
You promised not to tell.

92
00:04:20,839 --> 00:04:21,440
Oh, right.

93
00:04:21,519 --> 00:04:22,720
Are you still suing

94
00:04:22,720 --> 00:04:24,320
the extreme sports center?

95
00:04:24,320 --> 00:04:25,650
I went by the site today.

96
00:04:25,800 --> 00:04:27,160
If we go to court,

97
00:04:27,200 --> 00:04:28,920
it may take ages to open.

98
00:04:29,280 --> 00:04:30,560
I'm definitely suing.

99
00:04:30,640 --> 00:04:32,159
The way they laid out the space

100
00:04:32,159 --> 00:04:34,120
is nothing like my design.

101
00:04:34,840 --> 00:04:36,640
It's the principle of the thing.

102
00:04:36,659 --> 00:04:37,520
Okay.

103
00:04:37,760 --> 00:04:38,840
Send me your design drawings

104
00:04:38,840 --> 00:04:40,240
and the original contract.

105
00:04:40,240 --> 00:04:40,920
Okay.

106
00:04:41,200 --> 00:04:43,159
Good thing I've got a great lawyer.

107
00:04:43,190 --> 00:04:44,080
Oh, stop it.

108
00:04:44,680 --> 00:04:45,480
How about you?

109
00:04:45,600 --> 00:04:48,000
How's working with Attorney Sun?

110
00:04:48,280 --> 00:04:49,000
It's fine.

111
00:04:49,320 --> 00:04:51,180
There are so many business cases.

112
00:04:51,200 --> 00:04:52,400
I barely have time

113
00:04:52,400 --> 00:04:53,800
for community legal aid.

114
00:04:53,960 --> 00:04:56,070
Those cases don't come in every day.

115
00:04:56,680 --> 00:04:58,040
Besides, you can handle

116
00:04:58,040 --> 00:04:59,120
legal aid,

117
00:04:59,360 --> 00:05:00,280
lawsuits,

118
00:05:00,600 --> 00:05:01,600
and Shu Nianhe

119
00:05:01,960 --> 00:05:02,800
all at once.

120
00:05:02,800 --> 00:05:04,360
No problem, right?

121
00:05:04,760 --> 00:05:06,360
Mom's an octopus.

122
00:05:07,440 --> 00:05:08,770
Sit still while you eat.

123
00:05:09,600 --> 00:05:11,400
The robotics contest is next week.

124
00:05:11,400 --> 00:05:12,280
After dinner,

125
00:05:12,280 --> 00:05:13,720
can we practice for another hour?

126
00:05:13,720 --> 00:05:14,360
Can we?

127
00:05:14,560 --> 00:05:15,200
Sure.

128
00:05:16,120 --> 00:05:16,920
Great.

129
00:05:17,680 --> 00:05:19,240
Are you free next week?

130
00:05:19,600 --> 00:05:21,120
I can take her if you're busy.

131
00:05:21,120 --> 00:05:22,280
It's important.

132
00:05:22,280 --> 00:05:23,880
I'll make time.

133
00:05:24,080 --> 00:05:24,800
Besides,

134
00:05:24,880 --> 00:05:26,680
I can't ask you to do everything.

135
00:05:27,640 --> 00:05:29,040
If it's for you,

136
00:05:29,240 --> 00:05:30,280
I'd do it gladly.

137
00:05:31,910 --> 00:05:32,600
Mom.

138
00:05:32,600 --> 00:05:34,320
What does "do it gladly" mean?

139
00:05:40,200 --> 00:05:40,960
Well,

140
00:05:40,960 --> 00:05:43,020
He's entering the robotics contest.

141
00:05:43,240 --> 00:05:45,320
Even if she doesn't win gold,

142
00:05:45,680 --> 00:05:47,320
we'll learn a lot

143
00:05:47,320 --> 00:05:48,600
along the way

144
00:05:48,600 --> 00:05:49,840
and have fun doing it.

145
00:05:50,120 --> 00:05:51,840
That's what it means.

146
00:05:54,040 --> 00:05:54,400
Mom.

147
00:05:54,420 --> 00:05:55,280
That's wrong.

148
00:05:55,600 --> 00:05:56,680
How so?

149
00:05:56,920 --> 00:05:59,680
If I want the gold, I'll win it.

150
00:06:01,600 --> 00:06:03,000
Look at that confidence.

151
00:06:03,880 --> 00:06:05,800
Wonder where she gets it from?

152
00:06:06,280 --> 00:06:07,680
You, Mom, of course.

153
00:06:12,360 --> 00:06:13,320
What's wrong?

154
00:06:14,200 --> 00:06:16,000
Nothing. Let's eat.

155
00:06:18,320 --> 00:06:19,450
Have some more meat.

156
00:06:19,950 --> 00:06:21,210
You've gotten so thin.

157
00:06:35,530 --> 00:06:36,600
Shu Nianhe,

158
00:06:36,860 --> 00:06:38,920
you've been on the computer too long.

159
00:06:39,920 --> 00:06:41,480
You can have 30 more minutes.

160
00:06:41,480 --> 00:06:42,159
Okay?

161
00:06:47,050 --> 00:06:47,380
[Ruixin Technology]
[Ruixin launches another product]

162
00:06:47,400 --> 00:06:47,770
[Crushes Zhuoyuan Technology
in market share]

163
00:06:49,760 --> 00:06:53,560
Crushes Zhuoyuan Technology
in market share.

164
00:06:50,650 --> 00:06:51,620
[Ruixin Technology]
[Ruixin launches another product]

165
00:06:51,640 --> 00:06:52,909
[Crushes Zhuoyuan Technology
in market share]

166
00:06:57,280 --> 00:06:59,880
Mom, I know Zhuoyuan Technology.

167
00:07:01,320 --> 00:07:02,840
You do?

168
00:07:04,400 --> 00:07:05,520
That's my smart girl!

169
00:07:05,520 --> 00:07:06,760
You know so much!

170
00:07:07,760 --> 00:07:10,280
Our teacher used to give us

171
00:07:10,280 --> 00:07:12,320
Zhuoyuan learning tablets.

172
00:07:12,440 --> 00:07:13,720
They looked so cool.

173
00:07:14,440 --> 00:07:16,920
But we switched to new ones.

174
00:07:17,040 --> 00:07:18,520
They're not cool at all.

175
00:07:20,080 --> 00:07:21,400
Why'd they switch?

176
00:07:21,860 --> 00:07:24,020
Teacher said the old ones

177
00:07:24,050 --> 00:07:25,960
aren't made anymore.

178
00:07:25,980 --> 00:07:27,620
They couldn't get any more,

179
00:07:27,650 --> 00:07:29,480
so they switched brands.

180
00:07:32,240 --> 00:07:33,480
Mom.

181
00:07:35,070 --> 00:07:36,360
Let me pick one for you.

182
00:07:37,720 --> 00:07:39,200
How about this one?

183
00:08:32,409 --> 00:08:33,150
[Zhuoyuan Technology]

184
00:08:33,169 --> 00:08:34,470
[Zhuoyuan Technology Funding Fails,
Leadership Shakeup Follows]

185
00:08:38,240 --> 00:08:40,820
[Breaking: Zhuo Group Chairman
Zhuo Hong Dies]

186
00:09:02,600 --> 00:09:03,730
Hello, Director Li.

187
00:09:03,830 --> 00:09:04,650
Attorney Shu.

188
00:09:04,670 --> 00:09:06,360
Sorry to call so late.

189
00:09:06,600 --> 00:09:08,760
I'm reviewing another legal aid case.

190
00:09:08,790 --> 00:09:10,440
Think you'd be interested?

191
00:09:10,880 --> 00:09:12,680
Is it a tough one?

192
00:09:12,880 --> 00:09:13,640
Well,

193
00:09:13,640 --> 00:09:15,440
he's a distant relative of mine.

194
00:09:15,440 --> 00:09:17,000
Some kind of programmer.

195
00:09:17,280 --> 00:09:18,940
A big company wants damages from him.

196
00:09:18,940 --> 00:09:19,800
The poor kid

197
00:09:19,800 --> 00:09:21,000
worked himself sick.

198
00:09:21,000 --> 00:09:22,720
Medical bills ate up all his savings.

199
00:09:22,720 --> 00:09:24,280
His mother's seriously ill, too.

200
00:09:24,280 --> 00:09:25,770
He ran out of options,

201
00:09:25,790 --> 00:09:27,400
so he applied for legal aid.

202
00:09:27,680 --> 00:09:28,280
I see.

203
00:09:28,640 --> 00:09:29,880
When's he free?

204
00:09:29,880 --> 00:09:31,410
We can meet and talk it over.

205
00:09:31,600 --> 00:09:34,030
That's the tricky part, Attorney Shu.

206
00:09:34,200 --> 00:09:36,070
His mother has gotten worse,

207
00:09:36,240 --> 00:09:38,120
so he's in Senzhou.

208
00:09:40,130 --> 00:09:41,200
Senzhou?

209
00:09:41,760 --> 00:09:42,760
I understand.

210
00:09:42,760 --> 00:09:44,520
It's a tough case.

211
00:09:44,520 --> 00:09:46,680
If you have any doubts,

212
00:09:46,680 --> 00:09:47,680
that's okay.

213
00:09:47,680 --> 00:09:50,040
We can look for another lawyer.

214
00:09:52,350 --> 00:09:54,040
If you can't find one,

215
00:09:54,280 --> 00:09:56,280
what's the worst that could happen?

216
00:09:57,400 --> 00:09:59,000
Without a lawyer,

217
00:09:59,130 --> 00:10:01,480
the original ruling will stand.

218
00:10:01,600 --> 00:10:03,330
He'll be stuck paying the debt.

219
00:10:05,920 --> 00:10:06,980
I'll take the case.

220
00:10:18,170 --> 00:10:21,250
[Senzhou]

221
00:10:25,760 --> 00:10:26,560
Attorney Shu.

222
00:10:27,160 --> 00:10:28,760
Here's the trial court's ruling.

223
00:10:28,760 --> 00:10:29,480
And these

224
00:10:29,840 --> 00:10:31,760
are the exhibits we submitted.

225
00:10:32,280 --> 00:10:34,160
If we can get another hearing,

226
00:10:34,200 --> 00:10:35,080
I've got more evidence

227
00:10:35,080 --> 00:10:36,960
that they copied my work.

228
00:10:40,080 --> 00:10:41,680
If the new evidence holds up,

229
00:10:41,800 --> 00:10:43,880
we have a good shot on appeal.

230
00:10:45,270 --> 00:10:46,670
Leave these with me.

231
00:10:46,840 --> 00:10:48,280
I'll go through them right away

232
00:10:48,280 --> 00:10:50,340
and file a new request with the court.

233
00:10:51,920 --> 00:10:52,880
Attorney Shu.

234
00:10:53,320 --> 00:10:54,850
All this work you're doing,

235
00:10:54,920 --> 00:10:56,520
will it cost me anything extra?

236
00:10:56,520 --> 00:10:57,160
I...

237
00:10:57,560 --> 00:10:59,160
I'm afraid I can't afford it.

238
00:11:00,320 --> 00:11:02,000
You applied for legal aid,

239
00:11:02,040 --> 00:11:03,680
so I won't charge you a thing.

240
00:11:04,040 --> 00:11:04,600
And

241
00:11:05,040 --> 00:11:07,040
I'll fight for more compensation

242
00:11:07,760 --> 00:11:09,760
to help ease the burden.

243
00:11:10,520 --> 00:11:13,040
Being in debt is hard.

244
00:11:14,280 --> 00:11:15,080
I know.

245
00:11:15,680 --> 00:11:16,480
Attorney Shu.

246
00:11:17,120 --> 00:11:17,920
You--

247
00:11:19,280 --> 00:11:20,440
It's getting late.

248
00:11:20,960 --> 00:11:23,040
Go see your mother at the hospital.

249
00:11:25,920 --> 00:11:26,760
Thank you.

250
00:11:33,360 --> 00:11:34,280
Okay, Mr. Zhou.

251
00:11:34,280 --> 00:11:35,680
See you soon.

252
00:11:35,840 --> 00:11:36,720
Attorney Xiao.

253
00:11:37,400 --> 00:11:38,680
Attorney Shu is here.

254
00:11:38,680 --> 00:11:40,610
She's waiting in the meeting room.

255
00:11:40,900 --> 00:11:41,870
Okay.

256
00:11:44,920 --> 00:11:48,370
[Hongzheng Law Firm]

257
00:11:50,040 --> 00:11:50,840
Tinglan.

258
00:11:57,550 --> 00:11:58,400
Junhua.

259
00:11:58,710 --> 00:11:59,710
It's been a while.

260
00:12:03,200 --> 00:12:04,440
It sure has.

261
00:12:04,470 --> 00:12:05,870
I barely recognized you.

262
00:12:07,220 --> 00:12:09,480
If none of that had happened,

263
00:12:10,000 --> 00:12:10,840
you'd be one of

264
00:12:10,840 --> 00:12:12,880
Hongzheng's best lawyers by now.

265
00:12:13,760 --> 00:12:14,600
Who knew

266
00:12:14,720 --> 00:12:15,600
you'd take all that debt

267
00:12:15,600 --> 00:12:16,650
on yourself

268
00:12:16,680 --> 00:12:18,120
and leave without a word?

269
00:12:18,560 --> 00:12:19,890
Honestly, I admire you.

270
00:12:20,040 --> 00:12:21,280
That took real guts.

271
00:12:21,520 --> 00:12:22,650
What else could I do?

272
00:12:22,920 --> 00:12:24,080
I made the mistake.

273
00:12:24,520 --> 00:12:25,380
I couldn't make

274
00:12:25,400 --> 00:12:26,480
the whole firm

275
00:12:26,670 --> 00:12:27,800
pay for it.

276
00:12:28,840 --> 00:12:29,900
That took courage.

277
00:12:31,030 --> 00:12:32,560
I knew I was right about you.

278
00:12:33,120 --> 00:12:34,200
If you ask me,

279
00:12:34,320 --> 00:12:35,880
you're the one to admire, Junhua.

280
00:12:35,880 --> 00:12:37,160
Look at you now.

281
00:12:37,680 --> 00:12:38,880
You're practically

282
00:12:39,070 --> 00:12:40,600
half the boss at Hongzheng.

283
00:12:40,820 --> 00:12:41,760
You bet.

284
00:12:41,880 --> 00:12:43,270
Ever thought of coming back?

285
00:12:43,270 --> 00:12:45,130
You'd have more room to grow here.

286
00:12:47,320 --> 00:12:48,120
Junhua.

287
00:12:48,590 --> 00:12:49,560
You know

288
00:12:50,120 --> 00:12:51,250
it's not about work.

289
00:12:52,240 --> 00:12:53,520
I don't want to move back to Senzhou.
